The claim is supported by official evidence from Public Health England (PHE). The final standalone ["Weekly COVID-19 Surveillance Report week 40"](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5f76ed9bd3bf7f7c2921be81/Weekly_COVID19_Surveillance_Report_week_40.pdf) explicitly states it is the last such report, as "of 8 October 2020, the information in this report will be published in a combined Weekly flu and COVID-19 Surveillance Report on GOV.UK." This change is confirmed by the subsequent publication of the combined ["Weekly National Influenza & COVID-19 Report"](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5f7f354b8fa8f51e7b9dc623/Weekly_Flu_and_COVID-19_report_W41_FINAL.pdf) for week 41, covering data through early October 2020.